Error [E0121]: `p` was consumed by `consume`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/struct_use_after_move.jet:12:13
    |
 12 |     print(p.x)
    |             ^
 Why: after a value moves to another name, the old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: give away a copy instead (`~p`) where it moved
move site: source bytes 116..117; reuse site: source bytes 131..132; consuming callee: consume
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
